\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{A parent edge is read through the trace}
\date{2026-11-07}

\p{By the definition of the [gasket graph](fdip-00DP), the edge set of #{G_{n+1}} consists of
the edges of the child triangles. A parent edge is absent
from #{G_{n+1}}. \ref{fdip-00EM} bounds the resistance
between its endpoints by the trace in \ref{fdip-00DT}, which
equates the resistance on #{V_n} with the effective
resistance of #{H_n}.}
